Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Kaiba give me his\NFiend Sanctuary Magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it was something I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But can I trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.07,0:01:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for you to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That Magic card is Yugi's only chance\Nof defeating Marek's Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if Yugi does\Nfigure out how to use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,his chances of winning\Nthis duel are pretty slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Rai is a card like no other,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And although Yugi holds two\NEgyptian God cards himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,they pale in comparison\Nto Marek's Winged Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if you want to win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll use that card instead of counting\Non the support of your little fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he get that we're\Nall fighting the same enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He did give Yu-Gi that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd toss that\Ncard right off the tower, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yuge, no one said you had to use\Nthe card, so feel free to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we may not always\Nagree, but I still trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The last duel's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.15,0:02:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists, prepare your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek Ishtar will face Yu-Gi-Moto And the\Nwinner will receive the Battle City Crown
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for\Nthis moment for my entire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Life. Soon your infinite\Npower will be mine, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will I defeat you I'll free\Nyou from the darkness that controls you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'd like to see, so come and get\Nme. He's gross. Take him down, Yugi. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all you, man. I know that\NYu-Gi has two Egyptian God cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and Marek only has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yu-Gi's are gonna be\Ntougher to summon to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Because in order to\Nsummon Obelisk and Slifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi's gotta sacrifice\Na total of six monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But Marek has a way of summoning the\NWinged Dragon of Ra with just one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card, Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring back Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra, show yourself, my\Ngreat beast of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to witness its true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon of Ra has\Ntransformed into Egyptian god Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my beast can instantly destroy\Nevery monster on your side of the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's Egyptian God card has\Nso many special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost impossible to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba said that his fancy computer figured
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,out all the secrets of\Nthe winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe the card Kaiba gave to\NYugi can help him defeat Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoolists, please cut and\Nshuffle your opponent's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, shuffle well, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and hope with all of your soul\Nthat Ra ends up on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, man. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I gave Yugi a good\Ncard doesn't mean he'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have to figure out how\Nto use it, and even if he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll probably lose anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe then you'll stop believing\Nthat fairy tales come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's no Pharaoh, Ishizu, and he's\Nnot destined to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so wake up and stop living in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized a long time ago that the\Nonly way to succeed is to look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you that before this duel\Nis over, you will believe me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi thinks I gave him that\Ncard as an act of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship is for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your deck, Barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the shadows to consume your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Eric, destiny's on my side today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world is counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your foolish confidence\Nshows me that you have no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,comprehension of the true horror\Nthat awaits you in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's just trying\Nto psych you out, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe the floor with him and make\Nhim pay for everything he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists, take your places.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The final battle is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fate of mankind rests\Non your shoulders, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil that now controls\Nmy brother must be expelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are the only one\Ncapable of this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he prevails, the world\Nas we know it will perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence dueling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the fun begin, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have seen this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's another Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, you've witnessed\Nseveral of my Shadow Games before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but this one will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thrown in a few\Ntwists, especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our last chance to stop Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:07:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Pharaoh, it's time to reveal\Nthe first of my surprises for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,See someone familiar, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your dear friend, Mai,\Nslowly slipping into the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Once our duel ends, she'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't let this\Nmadness continue, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the only one who's\Nin danger here. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.35,0:07:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I said, I have several surprises\Nin store for you today. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my next victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what's at stake now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose the duel and Yugi\Ngoes to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, this is about you\Nand me, so leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting my weaker half!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's involved in this conflict as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I lose, the Shadows will take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm will claim an\Ninnocent soul no matter who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And now let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Vampiric Leech.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You've probably figured this out,\Nbut my Leech can attack instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You just lost 500 of\Nyour life points, Mero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When you lose life points, your friend will\Nlose a piece of himself to the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, when your life points reach\Nzero, not only will I win the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi will be gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same rule applies\Nto my former self!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control of this shadow game! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in my world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I can banish Yu-Gi to\Nthe Shadow Realm anytime I wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you who shall pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not realize this, but when\NYugi's body is consumed by the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh will cease to exist\Nin this world. For without a body,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,he's nothing but a wandering spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you and I first met, we\Nfaced everything together as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This Shadow Game is no different!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! I'm still right here next\Nto you, and we can defeat Eric together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the future of so many\Ndepends upon our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the most important\Nduel we've ever fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick were to prevail,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,he would gain all three Egyptian god cards,\Nalong with the key to infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And four innocent souls would\Nbe forever lost in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm now certain the reason Yugi and I were
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,brought together was so we\Ncould win this one duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Marek could think\Nof a game this sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If he loses, he'll be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat this guy, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's still my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So I shall activate another of\Nmy leech's special abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.09,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,By discarding one card, I can switch\Nmy leech back into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you choose a card\Nto dispose of so we can move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know exactly what card\NI'm sending to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is working perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my Egyptian God\Ncard is in the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can easily summon it back to the field\Nthanks to my Monster Reborn Magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My leech moves to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I'll place\None card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what Maric's strategy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He transferred his winged\Ndragon of Ra to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll use Monster Reborn to bring\Nit back, just like he did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my queen's knight in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll try to summon three monsters to\Nsacrifice for his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack his leech, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,my vampiric leech was in defense\Nmode, so I don't lose points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.97,0:12:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll continue my onslaught.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling Marek's gonna summon his
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian god card the same\Nway he did in my duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drawn just what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I use it, I have\None more thing to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I summon my Joragato in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my beast, destroy his queen's knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Just win this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate trap card, left-arm offering!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this card lets me move one\Nmagic card from my deck to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I've discarded every card I'm\Nholding, so I'll take the one card I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows each of us to draw\Na card from the other's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And hand over your Monster Reborn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.99,0:13:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, Hugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it. With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick can't bring\Nback his Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Little does he know I have\Nanother way to summon Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Monster Reborn to\Nbring back Queen's Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I shall summon my King's Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When King's and Queen's\NKnight are in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,their special ability\Nallows me to summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack's Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have three monsters on my side of\Nthe field, Merrick, and you have only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.67,0:14:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to sacrifice all three of\Nyour monsters so you can summon Slifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.99,0:14:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.99,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Merrick's right where you want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to rock his\Nworld now. Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick still has two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's got to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters outnumber mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.47,0:15:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he attacks, I'll\Nunleash my secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, has the mighty pharaoh realized\Nthat there's no way he can prevail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.99,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the pharaoh\Nis afraid to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi could have done some serious damage\Nif he attacked with one of his knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he did the right thing by\Nchilling out and waiting to attack, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got great instincts and\Nhe knew the time wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's definitely got\Nsomething up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one more card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,now I could end this shortly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,although it would be much more amusing to\Nextend this game and prolong your summary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're going to lose this duel\Nwhen I play my Egyptian God card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to offer you some assistance,\NPharaoh, so you can play yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.09,0:16:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I shall play this\Nmagic card, Card of Sanctity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So we must each draw from our deck until\Nwe're holding six cards in our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just consider that a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, select your cards and best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what you'll draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're about\Nto regret that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you drawn your Egyptian God card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you need more help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll switch Jurogedo to\Ndefense mode and end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Merrick, my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Barrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon your Egyptian god card, if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what the Great Sniper can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my Jax Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen's Knight, and my King's Knight\Nin order to summon Slifer, the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself, my all-powerful beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, the war begins! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Slip has got your back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And with 6,000 attack points, you're set!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Marix moved back by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what he does,\NDad Freak is toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So attack him and win this duel, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the power of Slifer\Nand its thunder force attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal magic card, Dark\NSpell Regeneration!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare card. With it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick can move any magic card he wants
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.79,0:18:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,from the card graveyard\Nback to the field now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and we both know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll choose to play\NMonster Reborn, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows me to revive my\Nmighty winged dragon of raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dragon, emerge in\Nyour unstoppable phoenix mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian god has neutralized\Nthe power of yours. In this mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,rise immortal for one whole turn\NSo nothing you do can stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is nuts And I ought to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it knocked me out cold Thanks\Nto the fiery wrath of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi will soon be consumed by\Ndarkness and absolute power will be mine!
